Package: RSYC
Title: Remote Sensing-Derived Yield Curves for Canada
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person(given = "Piotr", 
           family = "Tompalski",
           email = "piotr.tompalski@NRCan-RNCan.gc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Provides published remote sensing-based yield curves for
    aboveground biomass and total volume across Canada. Models are available
    for 150 km tiles and four levels of Canada's ecological land
    classification. Functions help users estimate yield at a given stand age
    and find curves by species and area.
